WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.850
I’m Ron from Analog Intelligence.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.900
Where on Earth can we find terrain like the Moon’s?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.100
Analog Coverage Gap Map compares NASA and ESA terrain data.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.100
Pick a Moon square, and it shows Earth candidates.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.450
Morocco matches this one, but it’s bumpier.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.800
We found candidates for six of sixty previously unmatched squares.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.850
The map helps teams decide where to investigate before choosing a test site.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.550
Thank you.
